# The product demo video. 16MB, and this repo is PUBLIC with no git-lfs, so it
# must NOT enter git history — the largest blob ever committed here is 1.56MB
# and every re-encode would add another permanent copy. It lives in public/ so
# the section works locally; for production it belongs on Vercel Blob and the
# URL goes in EXPLAINER in RemoteV2.tsx. The poster IS committed (60KB).
public/video/demo.mp4
